    "text": "By Davis Suppes ,\n1 days ago SARASOTA, Fla. (WWSB) - A bond hearing Friday morning for 83-year-old Walter Edgerton was postponed until Oct. 9. He was charged in the shooting and killing of his wife, who was allegedly suffering from severe pain and surgery recovery, begging for her pain to stop. He is charged with homicide... Read full article\n1",
